ckson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"EJeq9K5-ilBj8bSbCX4cMw","review_id":"3W1R-njMkk7iqdKgVgxC6w","date":"2020-11-14T10:29:51","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9459232091903687,"text_excerpt":"First time at this particular location and I was pleasantly surprised with the service. Considering the amount of negative reviews, I pondered coming but I'm glad I did. As with most restaurants these days, they were understaffed, but the two ladies working were fast, efficient and somewhat friendly. Not long after placing our order, our food came out hot, fresh and pretty appealing. As always, I ordered the chicken fajita omelette and it was delish! My hubby got the Colorado omelette, (as usual). I know, I know...we need to get more adventurous with menu their offerings. Perhaps one day. Suffice it to say, I couldn't find anything negative to say about this visit. They practiced social d..."},{"business_id":"EJeq9K5-ilBj8bSbCX4cMw","review_id":"2oiUv_VtcfQgSc02_75fYw","date":"2020-12-25T22:19:03","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9413496255874634,"text_excerpt":"I'm not sure why this location gets such bad reviews. It's a head scratcher. So, we decided to do something different this year and treated the kids to Christmas Day brunch. My wife and I ordered the breakfast sampler and the kids had chicken tenders. My sampler was bomb and such a great value. I had blueberry pancakes filled with blueberries, topped with blueberries and whipped cream, and drizzled in blueberry syrup. Oh yeah!! It had 4 tasty strips of bacon, 2 delicious sausage links, a serving of crispy, well seasoned hash browns and 2 scrambled eggs, which were on the overcooked side. I could excuse the eggs because everything else was on point. I don't even want to think about the cal..."},{"business_id":"EJeq9K5-ilBj8bSbCX4cMw","review_id":"8TJhOnKSyfxX9SCx7oLcgg","date":"2019-12-21T23:04:20","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9397768974304199,"text_excerpt":"I held off visiting because of all the poor reviews. My friend and I decided that maybe after being open for a while things had changed, and we were right. We were seated quickly and our food came out in a reasonable time frame. We both had omelets and pancakes, and we were pleased. The best part was our server, Kim. She was so pleasant, and she gave us above and beyond service."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"EJeq9K5-ilBj8bSbCX4cMw","photo_id":"cI8v7JIYUCccLBFwFsrAsw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/cI8v7JIYUCccLBFwFsrAsw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9026962518692017},{"business_id":"EJeq9K5-ilBj8bSbCX4cMw","photo_id":"BjLuDBi7p-CyeMxm7Sc6AQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/BjLuDBi7p-CyeMxm7Sc6AQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8080354332923889},{"business_id":"EJeq9K5-ilBj8bSbCX4cMw","photo_id":"H4C7F_Xy0W_LWs274f7fZw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/H4C7F_Xy0W_LWs274f7fZw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7995366454124451},{"business_id":"EJeq9K5-ilBj8bSbCX4cMw","photo_id":"4cS4B6WdOcm4vF70gGhZIg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/4cS4B6WdOcm4vF70gGhZIg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7981184720993042},{"business_id":"EJeq9K5-ilBj8bSbCX4cMw","photo_id":"e9ItkAdtn6nAGSiQzY4Zvw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/e9ItkAdtn6nAGSiQzY4Zvw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.780380368232727}]},"notebook_case":null}
